      "writtenOn": "2026-11-12T03:30:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This may be a case of breaking the ABI again, but I don\u0027t know that we need to carry the information around. What are your thoughts on adding APIs to retrieve the info from the (unparsed) package data buffer?",
      "revId": "695f31b17b3bbff85719c1af655b71683be65cf5",
